sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant J as Journal
  participant R as Receiver
  participant O as Observer
  S->>J: create attempts A and B for one event_id
  par barrier release
    S->>R: attempt A
  and
    S->>R: attempt B
  end
  R-->>S: bounded responses
  S->>J: append both outcomes
  S->>O: processing_count(event_id)
  O-->>J: count=1
